  "details": "1. Clear content cache, texture cache from Debug options.\n\n2. Restart the VRChat client.\n\n3. Open Quick Menu, navigate to Friend Locations with many, many friend locations.\n\n4. Scroll down quickly/slowly in Friend Locations.\n\nExpected behavior: Show a hourglass icon when icons are pending to be loaded when scrolling down in Friend Locations, for everyone.\n\nActual result: The icons shown are sometimes for wrong users, including previously loaded icons, before updating to the correct icons after a few seconds. Not everyone has a hourglass icon.\n\nAffects `Build 1903` and `Build 1913`.\n\nA video showcasing the issue is available privately in [Ticket #734844](https://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/requests/734844). (I don't want to put out my whole friends list out here in public.)",
